Z||000016||84Bill||11-27-2001||02:23 PM||||Firstly WELCOME to the forum  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Secondly Dont do it man! Save yourself!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>You will soon see how these little cars can be such a headache and so much fun at the same time. ADVICE Get two Fieros 1 to drive and the second to work on or use as a backup unit. If you like the car as much at most it will grow on you like a weed The history of the Fiero is short but interesting.<P>Good luck||||reg||14
